# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# vibe-editor is the TOOL, not your footage.
# Tracked: .claude/ skills, scripts/, templates/, README.md
# Ignored: everything below — your Premiere project, reels, media, renders.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Your brand -------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated on setup by `node scripts/brand.mjs scaffold` then `build`, and then
# customised per machine. brand.schema.json is the one hand-written file the
# script never writes — it only reads it to decide whether to emit $schema.
brand/*
!brand/brand.schema.json

# Cloned engines — reinstall or update with scripts/setup-macos.sh | setup-windows.ps1
vendor/
claude-video/

# Machine-specific MCP registration, written by the setup scripts
.mcp.json
.mcp.json.bak
.claude/settings.local.json

# Build artifacts
node_modules/

# --- Your working reels -----------------------------------------------------
# One folder per reel lives in projects/. They are yours, not the template's.
projects/*
!projects/.keep

# Scratch analysis / frame checks / audit stills.
# The OUTPUTS are scratch. The three GENERIC measurement scripts are part of the
# tool -- the skills call them as mandatory verification steps, so a clone
# without them cannot run the pipeline. Anything else you drop in here (frame
# compositors, preview builders) is per-project scratch carrying your own media
# paths and clip tables: it stays ignored on purpose.
analysis/*
!analysis/measure.py
!analysis/motion-density.py
!analysis/build-captions.py

# --- Media in / media out ---------------------------------------------------
# Reference reels are real creators' copyrighted work and are never redistributed.
# The folder is a bring-your-own slot -- see samples/README.md.
samples/*
!samples/README.md
# Rendered graphics live in projects/<slug>/renders/ and are ignored with it.
renders/
exports/*
!exports/.gitkeep

# --- Adobe Premiere Pro project + caches ------------------------------------
*.prproj
*.prproj.bak
*.prin
*.prlock
*.prel
*.psq
*.epr
Adobe Premiere Pro Auto-Save/
Adobe Premiere Pro Audio Previews/
Adobe Premiere Pro Video Previews/
Adobe Premiere Pro Preview Files/
Adobe Premiere Pro Captured Video/
Adobe Premiere Pro Captured Audio/
*.PRV/
*.cfa
*.pek
*.ims

# --- Loose media anywhere in the repo ---------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.avi
*.wav
*.aif
*.aiff
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.srt
*.vtt

# Loose screenshots dropped at the repo root
/Screenshot*.png
/screenshot*.png

# Licensed font binaries — commercial EULAs forbid redistribution.
# Each machine supplies its own copies into <project>/fonts/.
# See the font rules in .claude/skills/ig-show/reference/PIPELINE.md
**/fonts/*.otf
**/fonts/*.ttf
**/fonts/*.woff
**/fonts/*.woff2
!**/fonts/.gitkeep

# --- OS cruft ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
